41,You're in room with fur carpet.
42,You're in terminal room.
43,You're in Lippard room.
44,You're in Chamber of Ages.
45,You're in room with glaring light.
46,You're in twisted passage.
47,You're in Explore Experimentation Chamber.
48,You're in the basilisk's den.
49,You're outside the Vault of Tomorrow.
50,You are in the Vault of Tomorrow. The walls consist of blued steel,
