53,You're in room filled with dprints.
54,You're at edge of fissure.
55,You're on south side of fissure.
56,You're in room with no exits.
57,You're in passage blocked by debris.
58,You're in Limbo. If you just walked in here, contact Lippard.Scouting.
-1,end
